# POS / JavaScript

Full flow docs: `docs/bonuscard_pos_integration_explanation.md` and `.github/copilot-instructions.md`.

## Purchase Lifecycle

- Preserve the same transaction identifier across ValidatePurchase → FinalizePurchase / CancelPurchase.
- FinalizePurchase must match ValidatePurchase products/pricing unless API docs say otherwise.
- On payment abort or rollback, call CancelPurchase. Design for idempotency and retry safety.
- Bonuscard can return errors in JSON payload even on HTTP 200 — handle both layers.

## Patching Conventions

- `setPartnerToCurrentOrder` is already patched in `bonuscard_pos.js` — **extend** that patch, do not add a second patch on the same method.
- New partner fields for POS: add via `_load_pos_data_fields` on `res.partner`.

## Key Files

- `bonuscard_odoo/static/src/app/bonuscard_pos.js` — POS store patches
- `bonuscard_odoo/static/tests/unit/bonuscard_pos.test.js` — JS unit tests

When adding/renaming POS hooks, update `docs/bonuscard_pos_integration_explanation.md`
and `docs/bonuscard_pos_integration_diagram.mmd` in the same change.

When adding/changing/removing `_t("...")` or XML-visible POS labels, update
`bonuscard_odoo/i18n/sv_SE.po` in the same change (Translation Maintenance Rule in
`.github/copilot-instructions.md`).
